comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-15T15:27:12.262Z","harness:codex","Duplicate-check evidence 2026-08-15: all-status searches for GH-1033, fields empty group, requested empty collection, identity projection, and omission receipt found no item for this exact zero-exit projection failure. Closed pm-cxr0jb and pm-p258tx provide intent-projection and omission-receipt lineage; open pm-5t33or is the canonical universal output parent. This issue records the newly reported regression without duplicating those items."
  "2026-08-15T15:29:22.279Z","harness:codex","GitHub linkage evidence 2026-08-15: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1033#issuecomment-5302914118 points GitHub #1033 to this canonical PM item after all-status duplicate checks and typed lineage enrichment."
